{"title": "Find Familiar: Crab", "pageid": 17965, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Find_Familiar:_Crab", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Ritual spells", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Find_Familiar_Crab.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Find_Familiar_Crab.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Crab.webp, /w/images/d/df/Find_Familiar_Crab.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Find_Familiar_Crab.webp/300px-Find_Familiar_Crab.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Find_Familiar_Crab.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Find Familiar: Crab</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 conjuration spell</a>. This spell is a variant of the spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/38px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/50px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Familiar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp/25px-Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Find_Familiar_Cat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Find_Familiar\" title=\"Find Familiar\">Find Familiar</a> that summons a small crab.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a crab familiar that can slow enemies with its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maiming_Pinch\" title=\"Maiming Pinch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp/25px-Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp/38px-Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp/50px-Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crippling Pinch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp/25px-Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Maiming_Pinch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Maiming_Pinch\" title=\"Maiming Pinch\">Crippling Pinch</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/image